  characterName: Rokeya Chowdhury
  promptText: "My brand is markets as \u201Csustainable\u201D but relies on low-paid
    factory labour. Raising wages would improve dignity but may force closures and
    job losses; keeping wages preserves incomes now but perpetuates unfair work."
  leftAnswer: "Maintaining pay protects families\u2019 incomes while you seek fair
    transition paths."
  rightAnswer: Raising wages affirms dignity and justice, even if some jobs may be
    lost.
